msgid ""
"Dear %1$s %2$s,%3$sThis is regarding your recent payment and appointment "
"scheduling with the below details which is not successfully booked, despite "
"your payment being processed due to unforeseen technical glitches.%3$s%4$s -"
" %5$s - %6$s%3$sWe will process the refund for the full amount of your "
